<header><div class="brand"><div class="seal" aria-hidden="true">鳳</div><div><div class="brand-title">第五宫 · 佛道中心城</div><div class="brand-sub">FENIKSA CIVILIZACIO / CENTRA HALO</div></div></div><div class="edition"><span class="dot"></span><span class="edition-word">中央佛堂九供</span><span>双语有声 · R2</span></div></header><nav class="alignment-bar" aria-label="规划一致版导航"><a href="中央佛堂_汉语世界语双语读本_R1.docx">双语Word读本 / Dulingva legolibro</a><div><strong>05 · 中央佛堂</strong><span>中央九供 · Centra Budha Halo</span></div><a href="https://feniksa-civilizo-web4.vercel.app/museum/halls/C_DHARMA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">网站对应入口 ↗</a></nav>
<div class="app"><aside><div class="eyebrow">NINE OFFERINGS / A SHARED VOW</div><h1>中宫清净<br>九供同愿</h1><p class="intro">八大文明宫相环，<br>第五宫居中，佛道共学。<br>以供养心，以愿同行。</p><div class="rule"></div><div class="nav-heading"><span>中央佛堂九供</span><small>依您的清单暂编</small></div><nav id="hall-nav" class="hall-nav" aria-label="九供清单"></nav><div class="mobile-select"><label for="hall-select">查看供品</label><select id="hall-select"><option value="">第五宫全景</option></select></div><button id="supplements-open" class="catalogue-button">另件参考 · 佛头 / 天珠 / 佛堂照片</button><button id="archive-open" class="catalogue-button">旧册馆藏登记</button><div class="rule"></div><p class="source-note">照片：您提供的参考资料<br>名称：收藏者拟名，鉴定属性待核验<br><span id="source-count"></span></p></aside>
<main class="main"><div class="breadcrumb"><span>凤凰文明</span><span>›</span><span>第五宫 · 佛道中心城</span><span>›</span><strong>中央佛堂九供</strong></div><div class="scene-heading"><div><h2>以供养心 · 以愿同行</h2><p>八座外围建筑仅作文明宫体量示意；当前重点为中央佛堂展陈，非城市总规。</p></div><div class="view-controls"><button class="control" id="overview" aria-pressed="true">中宫鸟瞰</button><button class="control" id="court">九供庭院</button><button class="control" id="plan" aria-pressed="false">布局俯视</button><button class="control" id="night" aria-pressed="false">灯火黄昏</button><button class="control" id="labels-toggle" aria-pressed="true">供位</button></div></div>
